# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Working list, not a member of the document set and never ratified
docs/project/open-items.md
__pycache__/

# **The process documents are how the work is done, not what it ships.**
# `WeaverTools-Working-Process`, `-Document-Format`, `-Working-Rules` and
# `-Handoff-Format` govern the corpus rather than belonging to it, and the set
# cites them by document id rather than by path, so nothing in the tree dangles
# when they are not in it. Operator's ruling of 2026-09-14. They stay on every
# seat's disk and travel between seats the way a handoff does.
#
# **The instruments they describe are not in here and are tracked.** `gates/`
# and `ingest/` left this directory in the same act, because a gate that is not
# version controlled cannot be reviewed, cannot run in CI, and has no baseline
# anyone can diff. H6 is the census and the census is `gates/census.py`.
process/
